{"id": "99210310", "name": "סדרת סימנים מתחלפים – P(X_n = 1) ו-E[X_n]", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נגדיר סדרת משתנים מקריים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_0=1\\)</span>, ולכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_k=X_{k-1}\\)</span> בהסתברות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_k=-X_{k-1}\\)</span> בהסתברות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span>, באופן בלתי תלוי בשלבים הקודמים.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X_{ {{CT:2}} }]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X_{ {{CT:2}} }=1)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כותבים את \\(X_n\\) כמכפלה של סימנים בלתי תלויים; תוחלת של מכפלה של משתנים בלתי תלויים היא מכפלת התוחלות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — מכפלת סימנים</b><br>נסמן ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S_k\\)</span> את הסימן שבשלב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S_k=1\\)</span> בהסתברות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S_k=-1\\)</span> בהסתברות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span>. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_{ {{CT:2}} }=S_1S_2\\cdots S_{ {{CT:2}} }\\)</span>, וה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S_k\\)</span> בלתי תלויים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — התוחלת</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[S_k]={{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}}={{CT:3}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X_{ {{CT:2}} }]=\\prod_{k=1}^{ {{CT:2}} }\\mathbb{E}[S_k]=\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)^{ {{CT:2}} }={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — ההסתברות</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_{ {{CT:2}} }\\)</span> מקבל רק את הערכים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pm1\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X_{ {{CT:2}} }]=2\\mathbb{P}(X_{ {{CT:2}} }=1)-1\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X_{ {{CT:2}} }=1)=\\frac{1+\\mathbb{E}[X_{ {{CT:2}} }]}{2}=\\frac{1+\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)}{2}={{CT:5}} \\]</p><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">זו ההסתברות שמספר ההיפוכים, שמתפלג בינומית, הוא זוגי.</div></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "if pp^nn=t2 then -1 else pp^nn", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>זו ההסתברות שלא היה אף היפוך. גם אחרי מספר זוגי של היפוכים מקבלים \\(X_n=1\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["nn", "pp", "t1", "t2"], "nvariants": 48}